 "intro_zh": "几个世纪以来，许多著名的工程师和科学家到访此地，让这个城镇名气大增。这个古老的中世纪采矿中心，逐渐演变成为一个城镇，有文艺复兴时期的宫殿、16世纪的教堂、 精致的广场和城堡。城镇的中心和周围的环境融为一体，还保留着过去采矿和冶金活动的重要遗迹。",
 "intro_zh_source": "unesco_official",
 "intro_en": "Over the centuries, the town of Banská Štiavnica was visited by many outstanding engineers and scientists who contributed to its fame. The old medieval mining centre grew into a town with Renaissance palaces, 16th-century churches, elegant squares and castles. The urban centre blends into the surrounding landscape, which contains vital relics of the mining and metallurgical activities of the past.",
 "intro_en_source": "unesco_official",
